window.products.push({"id":402023,"name":"Howard Miller Gwyneth Wall Clock 625-340 – Modern, Two-Toned Brushed Nickel & Satin Black Finishes, Spun Silver Finished Pendulum Bob, Quartz Movement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FnyQIR6gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WALL CLOCK: The Gwyneth Wall Clock features a two-tone brushed nickel and satin-black finishes to compliment your home decor. The clock’s spun silver-finished pendulum bob makes a soft ticking noise without the use of chimes for a quieter environment. DURABLE: This indoor modern clock is created to last. It has a sturdy metal frame to relieve stress in a busy household. Display it in your kitchen, office, bathroom, bedroom, living room, and more. HIGH QUALITY: The contemporary wall clock will quickly become a home essential. Easily tell time with the silver Arabic numerals and hands with flat glass crystal to stand out over a black dial. DIMENSIONS: The height of this clock is 33 inches (84 cm), with a width of 12.5 inches (32 cm) and a depth of 3 inches (8 cm). It is powered by quartz movement and requires two AA sized batteries (not included). HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world’s leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FnyQIR6gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B001C5Z5NY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-402023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001C5Z5NY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001C5Z5NY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
