window.products.push({"id":402137,"name":"Bush Furniture Reflections TV Stand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/318lgFlSH8L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Reflections Collection boasts stylish contemporary design with its beveled edges, distinct finishes and functional simplicity. Amazon.com Clearly designed for today's TV configurations, Bush Furniture's Reflections Swivel video base incorporates a number of essential amenities for modern usage. First, the roomy top accommodates most 32-inch conventional TVs (up to 176 pounds) and most 42-inch flat-panel TVs (up to 100 pounds). A swiveling shelf allows the TV to turn left or right to always provide a comfortable viewing angle. Below, two glass doors protect components from dust or damage, while a center compartment features a stylish door made of speaker-grill fabric. Open this door, and there's a pullout shelf for gaming. Crafted in an inviting furniture style with a black finish, the base is clean and simple, so it easily blends with many decors. Some assembly is required, though it comes with timesaving, install-ready features. Instructions and a toll-free customer help line are also included. The video base measures 47-1/2 inches wide by 22-1/8 inches deep by 20-5/8 inches high. Six-year warranty. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/318lgFlSH8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B000W8OUGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-402137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000W8OUGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000W8OUGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":402138,"name":"BHARAT HAAT Bastar Tribal Dhokra Art Brass Horse showpiece handicrafts Product BH06442","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":83.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814awkt6fGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dhokra Craft is the earliest known method of non-ferrous metal casting known to human civilization. The name Dhokra or Dokra was initially used to indicate a group of nomadic craftsmen, and is now generically applied to a variety of beautifully shaped and decorated brassware products created by the lost wax process. In India, these craftsmen are clustered in the states of Madhya Pradesh, Bihar, Orissa and West Bengal. Dhokra Craft is made by different communities like the Situlias, Ghantaras, Thataries, Ghasis, Bathudis and other professional Dhokra workers. The Dhokras use lost-wax process to cast hollow brass objects and images. A replica of the desired product is made with wax on a clay core, with all its finer details of designs and decorations. Brass scrap in generally used as raw material. Crafted out of metal through indigenous methods, the distinctive design and form of Dhokra craft reflects the inherent expression of their feelings. It was used for making everything from making jewelry to vessels to images of gods, goddesses, animals and birds. Ambiguity exists in regard to whether the Dhokra Craft is a genuinely preserved tradition or a repetition of what they have been told about themselves. The Dhokras are now called karamkars. The Dhokra craft work is done both by men and women.Beautiful Decorative bastar art design horse showpiece for home office use as well as giftting purpose.Disclaimer: Due to various types of lightings and flash used while photoshoot,the color shade of the product may vary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814awkt6fGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BHARAT HAAT","source_asin":"B079RDJ88F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-402138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079RDJ88F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079RDJ88F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
