window.products.push({"id":402154,"name":"AmorArc 24 Ounces Soup Bowls with Large Handles and Lids, Stoneware Bowls Set of 2 for Soup,Cereal,Stew,Noodle, Colourful Ceramic Kitchen Bowls, Micro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514xxj0-4ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HEALTHY & EXCELLENT VALUE:These bowls are crafted from eco-friendly clay and fired at high temperatures to ensure that they are free of harmful substances like lead and cadmium. This means that you can safely enjoy your meal without worrying about any toxins leaching into your food. Twice fired premium stoneware make it sturdy, durable and chip-resistant for long use. PERFECT SIZE: 24oz capacity are versatile for many kinds of food service at home-- french onion soup,stews, chili, soup,noodle or any very saucy dish, Perfect for family dinners, food storage, breakfast oatmeal, restaurant service and party, Use this container to start meal prepping your work lunches. The portion size is perfect and helps ensure you don't overeat. HANDSOME BOWLS WITH LARGE HANDLES ：How many times you’ve burned your hands with holding your hot dishes or soup? t The large handles make it easy to grab from the microwave without burning your fingers. The lid's venting feature makes it easy to use in the microwave without splatters and reduces heating time. CONVENIENT AND SPACE -SAVING: made of durable ceramic, these bowls are stackable and dishwasher,microwave,freezer safe! You also can wash them with soap and hot water easily. Humanized design make it take up a little space in your cabinet GREAT GIFT IDEA: Packaged in a well-wrapped box, our soup bowls make a thoughtful and practical gift for birthdays, holidays, or special occasions. Whether you're giving them as a gift or keeping them for yourself, these soup bowls are sure to please. Tips: Plastic vented lids can be used in the microwave but should be removed before heating and placed on top while unlatched. Plastic lids are leak-proof but not intended to be used upside down or submerged under water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514xxj0-4ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AmorArc","source_asin":"B0BML5ZZ7F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-402154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BML5ZZ7F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BML5ZZ7F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
