window.products.push({"id":402353,"name":"Klee Utensils 6-Piece Stainless Steel Portion Control Ladles with Long Handles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gD84cZyOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Portion control is a vital step in the food industry and for those trying to lose weight . Since most people tend to eat almost everything they serve themselves, it’s important to control portions to prevent overeating. These Portion Control Ladles from Klee Utensils are outfitted with a color-coded handle , allowing you to easily recognize the size for proper measurement. Featuring a red (2oz), green (4oz) and blue (8oz) ladle in both a solid design for serving food and perforated design to allow liquids to pass through, you can easily prepare and serve proper portions of ingredients and food. Each ladle is expertly constructed of high-quality stainless steel that won’t rust or dent, ensuring long-term durability and continual use for years on end. Additionally, this material doesn’t retain odors or leach harmful chemicals to provide a safe eating experience. Whether you’re preparing, cooking or serving food, these ladles are a must-have. With 2-, 4- and 8-ounce sizes, you can easily measure ingredients, mix them up , and – when it’s time to enjoy eating your scrumptious cuisine – serve out portions to loved ones. The last thing you want to do when cooking over a hot, boiling pot is burn your hands. To prevent that from happening, each ladle features an extra-long handle to accommodate virtually every size pot. For convenience, measurements are also engraved on each ladle for instant capacity recognition. Restaurants, cafeterias and institutions need to serve proper portions to their customers and patrons to ensure a successful bottom line. Individuals and dietitians involved in diet and weight control need to do the same. To that end, each ladle is equipped with an easy-grip handle , allowing for a precise measurement of food every time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gD84cZyOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KLEE UTENSILS","source_asin":"B07MFBP9HV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-402353","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MFBP9HV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MFBP9HV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
