window.products.push({"id":402660,"name":"Set 2 Gold Perfume Vanity Tray, Bathroom Tray with Metal Frame, Decorative Tray for Dresser Bathroom Jewelry or Home Decoration (L+S)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PYFODNjVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌟【Large Capacity in Two Pieces】This 2-piece gold perfume tray set provides ample space for organizing your dressing table, displaying and storing perfume, jewelry, rings, earrings, necklaces, trinkets, and vanity essentials within easy reach. Large tray measures 12.6x8.5x2.2 inches, and small tray measures 10x7x2.2 inches. Easy to clean and maintain ✨【Exquisite Craftsmanship】Our gold mirror tray features a clear glass surface with a gold metal frame, ensuring smooth and delicate edges. Each corner and edge is hand-welded to perfection. The gold vanity tray bottom is lined with felt, protecting your furniture from scratches caused by the dresser trays 🏠【Elegant Gold Decor】Add sophistication to your bedroom, bathroom, or living room with this stunning gold bedroom decor piece. Our gold tray decorative set is perfect for displaying perfume, cosmetics, and other vanity essentials, elevating your home decor and serving as a stylish bathroom vanity tray 📚【Multi-Functional】These gold bathroom trays can be used to store and display a variety of items, including jewelry, makeup, perfume, toiletries, candles, and more, making them a versatile addition to any room in your home 🎨【Versatile Display Tray】This gold decor for the bedroom can also be used as a display tray for candles, makeup, toiletries, or decorative items in your living room, dining room, or entryway. The glass tray for vanity offers endless possibilities for showcasing your favorite items 💕【Durable & Skid-Resistant】The gold tray for bathroom is designed with skid-resistant rubber pads and a soft velvet bottom, ensuring stability and preventing scratches on your countertops or furniture 🎁【Perfect Gift Choice】Surprise your loved ones with this exquisite perfume tray organizer. Ideal for birthdays, Christmas, or anniversaries, our gold vanity tray adds a touch of luxury to any setting and makes a great addition to bedroom dresser decor 💧【Easy to Clean】The glass perfume tray features a smooth, easy-to-clean surface, making it perfect for use in any room. Simply wipe it down with a damp cloth to keep it looking new and shiny 🌹【Sophisticated Design】The gold mirror trays for vanity add a touch of elegance to any space with their sophisticated design, making them an excellent choice for enhancing your home's aesthetic 🔒【EQEY PRODUCT WARRANTY】If you have any concerns about your purchase, please do not hesitate to contact us. The EQEY support team will patiently answer any questions you may have. Due to the particular technology and material of this product, please contact us if you are not satisfied with it after receiving it. We strive to provide excellent quality products that fit perfectly in your home","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PYFODNjVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EQEY","source_asin":"B09SYPQXX6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-402660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SYPQXX6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SYPQXX6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":402661,"name":"Rachael Ray Cucina Dinnerware 4-Piece Stoneware Fruit Bowl Set, Almond Cream","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vO-sdBKlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Harvest plenty of fresh, colorful style when serving fruits, berries and more with the Rachael Ray Cucina Dinnerware 4-Piece Stoneware Fruit Bowl Set. Rachael Ray Cucina blends relaxed, rustic style with modern functionality and durability and these fruit bowls are as ideal for brunch in the breakfast nook as an alfresco dinner on the backyard patio. The bowls are perfect for serving everything from fresh, juicy strawberries, sliced ripe bananas, or home-stewed compote and the 8-ounce capacity will hold half of a sweet, luscious grapefruit. Crafted from durable stoneware and glazed with warm, earthy color, the bowls brandish just the right touch of handcrafted texture with an antiqued look. Partner these distinctive side bowls with the coordinating Rachael Ray Cucina dinnerware and serve ware. And add even more of Rach's great cookware, tools and pantry ware from the full Cucina collection to build a great-looking, easy-going kitchen where it's fun to cook, serve and entertain. Oven safe up to 250 for 20 minutes to warm foods, the stoneware dishes are also conveniently microwave, freezer and dishwasher safe. Market to table, orchard to buffet, the sturdy, colorful Rachael Ray Cucina Dinnerware 4-Piece Stoneware Fruit Bowl Set makes the ideal foursome for fruits and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vO-sdBKlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rachael Ray","source_asin":"B0107LKBR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-402661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0107LKBR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0107LKBR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":402662,"name":"MLB Atlanta Braves Fan Cakes Heat Resistant CPET Plastic Cake Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K1NDGw+EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get creative with the Pangea Brands Fan Cake. This cake pan allows you to bake your favorite team dessert at home. Follow cake mix or recipe for baking instructions, and then use the mixing chart on the back to create your favorite team's colors for the icing. This cake is sure to be a hit at your next party or event. The possibilities are endless with the Pangea Brands Fan Cake. Not only is it great for baking cakes, but the pan can be used to freeze your favorite team's ice sculpture, mold your favorite team's chocolate sculpture or gelatin, or even create your favorite team's concrete garden stone. Get your Pangea Brands Fan Cake today and let the creativity begin!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K1NDGw+EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pangea","source_asin":"B004R67ZVU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-402662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004R67ZVU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004R67ZVU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
