window.products.push({"id":402729,"name":"Granite Ware 12-Quart Soup Pot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":92.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N9Pvu6ocL._AC_SL1073_.jpg","description":"This 12 Qt soup pot is perfect size for cooking all your favorite soups and great for Sous Vide cooking. Granite Ware pots are constructed of low carbon steel with porcelain glass coating. There are no PFOA's or other chemicals to alter food's taste, color or healthfulness. Dark porcelain surface and steel core absorbs energy and evenly distributes heat to the contents. Porcelain enamel is the result of fusing powdered glass to a substrate by firing, usually between 750 and 850 degrees Celsius. The powder melts and flows and hardens to a durable vitreous coating on a carbon steel core. It creates a smooth, hard finish that won’t burn and resists staining. It’s also non-porous so it won’t trap odors or food particles and provides a low coefficient of friction – meaning that it cleans up easily and, it is corrosion and chemically resistant so it will last a long time. When fired, the vessel is placed on pins so the bottom and sides are hardened during the firing process into one smooth laminated glass surface. You may notice slight pin indentations where the glass has flowed around the pin that supports the base during firing. The pin marks do not compromise the finish or performance of the vessel. Not recommended for use on glass cooktops.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N9Pvu6ocL._AC_SL1073_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Granite Ware","source_asin":"B00IAA12HC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-402729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IAA12HC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IAA12HC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
