window.products.push({"id":402820,"name":"Gmhehly LED Bathroom Mirror with Lights, 32x24 Inch LED Backlit + Front Lighted Bathroom Smart Mirror for Vanity with High Lume, Anti-Fog and Dimmable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716G+hF+3nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High CRI LED Light】This bathroom mirrors for vanity compared with a conventional mirror, this 5mm copper free silver mirror that will give you 35% more clarity. The CRI of over 95 ensures perfect color rendering and makes these lights a perfect fit for all those chores looking for accurate color discrimination. 【Smart Design】Built-in backlit motion sensor. When you get close enough the mirror (less than 1.5m), the backlight will be turned on automatically, and it be will turned off when you leave. IP67 waterproof rating is ideal for using over a sink or in a steamy statement. Explosion-proof film is stick on the back of mirror to protect your family away from broken glass when the mirror damaged by accident. 【Dimmable Light and Brightness Memory】The front light of the bathroom mirror has 3 color temperature : 2700K, 4500K and 6000K. The brightness of the light can be adjusted from 10% to 100% using the touch sensor button on mirror. Memory function allows the last light temperature and brightness setting to be recalled when you turn on the switch. 【Anti-Fogged and Automatic Shutdown 】Built-in anti-fog pad ensures the mirror stays clear and fog-free after shower. The mirror defogger switch and light switch can be controlled separately. Turn on the anti-fog function when necessary, safe and energy-saving. The front light and anti-fog function would be turned off automatically after one hour of using . 【Long Lifetime and Easy Installation】This bathroom mirror with lights feature high quality. Power supply and LED lights are UL listed which have more than 50,000 hours lifespan. Using U shape hanger,you can install the mirror easily in less than 20 minutes. If there are any problem with the mirror, please feel free to contact us. We will solve all questions within 12 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716G+hF+3nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gmhehly","source_asin":"B0B18KHZKT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-402820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B18KHZKT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B18KHZKT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
