window.products.push({"id":402918,"name":"GEEZO 12V/24V Smart Temperature Control Travel Coffee Mug for Car/Truck,Electric Heated Travel Mug 450ML Stainless Steel Tumbler Smart Heating Cup Kee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rqVlRDMHL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍵12V/24V Coffee cup Compatible with Most Baby Bottles: Size: 9 in*3.5 in, Capacity : 13OZ or 380ML ,Suitable for 99% Breast storage bag , 90% Standard feeding bottle , 80% Larger Feeding Bottle. Ideal for hot water, coffee, tea, beverage, etc.Our 12v/24V coffee cup avalible for 12V or24V bus or truck. 🍵 Safe material - The temperature control travel mug body is made of \"Tritan\" material developed for advanced baby bottles. It adopts medical grade 304 stainless steel, advanced internal pull-up technology, no weld seam and welding slag inside . High capacity is 13OZ,the heated cup is very suitable for cooking, cooking eggs, gifts, work, school, travel, camping. And baby milk. 🍵 Easy to use - Temperature control travel coffee mug uses \"+\" or \"- \" button to set temperature, LCD display temperature, there are two colors in different states, red indication is In the heating mode, the blue indicates the heating completed. When the blue color is displayed, you can taste it and enjoy the pleasure of drinking coffee or tea from the first mouth to the last drop.It takes about 15 minutes to heat from normal temperature Coffee to 149 °F. 🍵 Safe use-This is a new type of smart mug. It can be taken out from the 304 stainless steel cup and rinsed with running water. After drying, it can be installed back. It avoids the external circuit chip touching the water and is safer to use. When the water volume is too small or the cup is tilted, the car heating mug will automatically close .Heated coffee mug for car is quiet and no noise when heated. 🍵 Gift of the best choice - Our coffee cups heated has innovation and excellent quality, will be the perfect Christmas gift for your family and friends, colleagues, Thanksgiving gifts or birthday gifts. If you have any questions or concerns about this item, please contact us for free on the ordering page, we promise to give you a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rqVlRDMHL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GEEZO","source_asin":"B0C3YM1F6P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-402918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3YM1F6P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3YM1F6P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
